WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.051
Radio sends small messages between micro:bits.

2
00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:10.605
radio set group picks a channel. Only micro:bits in the same group hear each other.

3
00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:14.862
send number goes to every other micro:bit in the group.

4
00:00:17.866 --> 00:00:22.991
on radio received is an event. It runs each time a message arrives.
